  "description": "Owen Reilly is delighted to present this superb one bedroom apartment well located in Grand Canal Dock featuring an A2 BER. Located on the fourth floor at Opus, 6 Hanover Quay in the centre of Dublin's Docklands. Living at Opus offers residents a range of exclusive amenities and a level of service that is second to none. Amenities include a spacious and bright entrance lobby where you will be greeted by the concierge, well equipped on-site gym, a communal roof terrace with entertaining space, business pods with WIFI, laundry and dry-cleaning services, package and parcel collection, shared car rental, concierge team based on site 7 days a week, 24-hour security and on-site custodian to take care of your maintenance needs.\n\nResidents will also be able to avail of soft services such as housekeeping service, local business recommendations. Storage rooms and underground car parking spaces are available at extra cost.\n\nThe interior accommodation comprises open plan living/dining/kitchen area with an abundance of natural light, a double bedroom with extra-length headboards, fitted wardrobes and under-bed storage. The main bathroom comes complete with a bath.\n\nPlease call or email the Owen Reilly team today to arrange a viewing.\n\nMore about the location...\n\nGrand Canal Dock is a vibrant city quarter that has a selection of unrivalled amenities yet is only a fifteen minute walk from Grafton Street and the city centre. Hanover Dock is located just off Sir John Rogerson’s Quay adjacent to the Grand Canal Theatre and the Marker Hotel. Ballsbridge, the city centre, IFSC and Sandymount are all within walking distance. Large s in the area include Google, TikTok and Salesforce which ensures a strong rental market. Transport links are numerous with the Dart and Luas only five minutes away.\n\nFeatures:\n\nOne bedroom apartment on the fourth floor.\nPrime location on Hanover Quay.\nA2 BER.\nSpacious and bright entrance lobby with on-site concierge.\nOn-site gym.\nTwo roof terraces located on the seventh and eighth floors.\nBusiness pods which will have free WiFi services.\nLaundry and dry-cleaning services.\nLuxury shared car option.\nOptional underground car parking space & bicycle parking.\nConcierge team based on site 7 days a week.\n24-hour security.",
